{"name":"Old Soul","hex":"#918d80","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"old soul","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A reincarnated person.","A person of unusual maturity."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/old_soul"}],"entries":[{"title":"Old Souls (book)","blocks":[{"text":"Old Souls: The Scientific Search for Proof of Past Lives is a non-fiction book by journalist Tom Shroder. An editor at The Washington Post, Shroder traveled extensively with psychiatrist Ian Stevenson of the University of Virginia, who conducted past life and reincarnation research in Lebanon, India and the American South. Shroder's journalistic experience makes this book a valuable review of an often disparaged subject."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/17/Old_Souls_-_The_Scientific_Evidence_For_Past_Lives.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Souls_(book)","wikidata":"Q7084998"},{"title":"Old Soul (album)","blocks":[{"text":"Old Soul is the fourth studio album by Jamaican-American musician Stephen Marley. It was released on September 15, 2023."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c3/StephenMarley-OldSoul.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_Soul_(album)","wikidata":"Q123663334"},{"title":"Soul","blocks":[{"text":"In religion and philosophy, the soul is the immaterial aspect or essence of a living being. It is typically believed to be immortal and to exist apart from the material world. Anthropologists and psychologists have found that most humans believe in the existence of a soul or spirit, and that they have cross-culturally distinguished between the soul and the material body."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c8/Schiavonetti_Soul_leaving_body_1808.jpg/330px-Schiavonetti_Soul_leaving_body_1808.jpg?utm_sou